      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Ciao, this is Yeshwanth Balaji. AI can write an answer that sounds perfect and is completely wrong. So how do engineers decide whether a model can be trusted? Let's open the toolbox researchers use to test it.",
