    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "So how do you check the work? Researchers use a toolbox. Metrics that score answers against reference answers. Benchmarks: one test for every model. Head-to-head comparisons. Bias tests. Ways to look inside the model. And human review. Nik Bear Brown's survey paper collects most of these. Let's open them.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 18.8,
