    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Benchmarks solve a different problem: comparing models fairly. Every model takes the same test, scored the same way, and a leaderboard ranks them. A-B testing does the same for two versions of one model: same prompts, side by side, and you count which answers people prefer. But the survey warns that chasing a leaderboard can mean over-optimizing for the test. One score never tells the whole story.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "estimated_duration_s": 25.8,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
